OL,3,AUS borrowing costs rise as attempts to
OL,4,Aease rates prove short-lived
OL,5,
OL,6,FEconomists said the surprise move by
OL,7,Fthe US government had proved
OL,8,Fshort-lived, with ongoing concerns over
OL,9,Fthe level of borrowing as national debt
OL,10,Fpassed $40tn.
